                "string": "Overall memory term dependency on time after dilution, Fold Change, and doubling time. A) Overall memory term, Θ vs time after dilution as a function of Fold Change. Doubling time is set to 40 min. B) Overall memory term, Θ vs time after dilution as a function of doubling time. Fold Change set to 10. https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1011696.g003"
